# StablePulse frontend environment
# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in as needed. Do not commit .env.
#
# The frontend fetches live market data browser-direct (DefiLlama + CoinGecko),
# so no keys are needed for the core dashboard. This file only configures the
# optional AI/backend pointer.

# Optional: point the frontend at your AI/backend service (the lite VPS in
# backend/). Empty default means same-origin (nginx serves /api/ai next to the
# static app) and the AI layer is disabled when no backend is present.
# Runtime window.STABLEPULSE_CONFIG.aiApiBase wins over this build-time value.
#   STABLEPULSE_AI_API_BASE=https://your-backend.example.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI API keys: NOT here. The AI narrative is generated on the backend
# (backend/jobs/ai.js), never in this frontend. Keys stay server-side in
# backend/.env (git-ignored). See backend/.env.example for those keys:
#   OPENAI_BASE_URL   e.g. https://api.openai.com/v1 (any OpenAI-compatible host)
#   OPENAI_API_KEY    your key
#   OPENAI_MODEL      e.g. gpt-4o-mini
#   AI_CADENCE_MIN    120 (minimum minutes between narratives, self-gated)
#
# This frontend only renders whatever the backend returns and degrades
# gracefully when AI is absent.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------